<title>JAPAN: Fujikura rises on robust earnings.</title>
<headline>Fujikura rises on robust earnings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Fujikura Ltd rose on Tuesday morning on robust earnings announced on Monday, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0027 GMT, the shares in the large electric wire and cable maker were up 19 yen at 997. It was the most heavily traded issue on the first section of the Tokyo bourse, with trade totalling 2.03 million shares.</p>
